Package: keyringd-wsl
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Keyringd maintainers <info@keyringd.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/keyringd/keyringd
Depends: init-system-helpers (>= 1.61)
Conflicts: keyringd
Description: Passkey-backed SSH agent for Windows and WSL
 Keyringd combines a TPM-backed SSH key with a FIDO authenticator and an
 OpenSSH certificate. This package includes the Linux WSL proxy and its native
 Windows companion executable.
